@startuml View Profile - Sequence Diagram

actor Customer
participant "ProfileController" as ProfileCtrl
participant "Auth" as Auth
participant "User" as User
participant "View" as View

== View Profile ==
Customer -> ProfileCtrl: edit()
ProfileCtrl -> Auth: user()
Auth --> ProfileCtrl: current_user
ProfileCtrl -> View: show profile.edit(user)
View --> Customer: display profile page

@enduml
